Description: Provides marker-aware gating and classification methods for cell
    type annotation in spatial protein imaging data. The package constructs interpretable
    cell-type gating hierarchies, quantifies annotation uncertainty, and supports
    supervised prediction of cells that cannot be confidently gated. It operates
    on SummarizedExperiment and SpatialExperiment objects to support interoperable
    analysis of single-cell spatial proteomics data.
